|Description={{en|1=The '''Coat of arms of Manchester City Council''', the local government authority for the City of Manchester, in Greater Manchester, England. The blazon is:<br>'''''ARMS:''' Gules three Bendlets enhanced Or a Chief Argent thereon on Waves of the Sea a Ship under sail proper.''<br>'''''CREST:''' On a Wreath of the Colours a Terrestrial Globe semee of Bees volant all proper.''<br>'''''SUPPORTERS:''' On the dexter side a Heraldic Antelope Argent attired collared and chain reflexed over the back Or and on the sinister side a Lion guardant Or murally crowned Gules each charged on the shoulder with a Rose of the last.''}}
